df -hT
2. du – Disk Usage
Purpose: Shows space used by files and directories.
Focuses on individual directories/files, not the whole filesystem.
Basic Usage
du /home
Output (size in KB) for each subdirectory:
/home/user1 20480
/home/user1/docs 10240
/home/user1/downloads 10240
Common Options
Option	Purpose
-h	Human-readable (MB/GB)
-s	Summary only (total size of directory)
--max-depth=N	Limit recursion depth to N levels

