blkid
Output example:
/dev/sda1: UUID="3f2b1c4e-1d8b-4b3b-8f9c-2d5a7b2c1a2f" TYPE="xfs" PARTUUID="0001"
/dev/sda2: UUID="7c5d8e6f-2b3c-4a7f-9c1d-3e2b4c5a6f7d" TYPE="swap" PARTUUID="0002"
/dev/sda1 – device name
UUID – universally unique identifier for the filesystem
TYPE – filesystem type (xfs, ext4, swap, etc.)
